  (text "LINEAR REGULATORS\n- U104 TPS7A4701 ANY-OUT +16.0 V (6.4+6.4+1.6+0.2 grounded). U106 TPS7A4701 +5.0 V (3.2+0.4).\n- U105 TPS7A3301 -16.1 V = -1.176 V x (1 + 127k/10k). Pad = GND, EN = IN (datasheet).\n- U107 LT3042 +3V3A (100 uA x 33.2k) for oscillators and converters.\n- Put every thermal pad on copper pour; the +-16 V LDOs dissipate ~0.7 W at full power."
    (at 20 257 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.524 1.524)
      )
      (justify left top)
    )
    (uuid "fc21e69b-0990-5c04-ade0-964e6e4f5f02")
  )
